entries[253145] = { ["name"] = "Khaz'gorian Smithing Hammer", ["text"] = "3.5 sec cast\nTools: Blacksmith Hammer\nReagents:\nTitan's Blood (30), Precision Blessing Tools , Azerokk's Fist , Storm Silver Ore (30), Platinum Ore (20), Expulsom (10)\nCreate a Khaz'gorian Hammer.\nQuest:\nA Recipe For the Ages\nZone:\nTiragarde Sound\n\nQuest:\nA Recipe For the Ages\nZone:\nZuldazar\n\nKhaz'gorian Smithing Hammer\nBinds when picked up\nUniqueBlacksmithing Tool\nWhen crafting blacksmithing armor or weapons, there's a chance it will be given the \"Indestructible\" property.\nUse: Allows the user to repair a piece of their equipment instantly. (1 Hour Cooldown)\nEquip: +4 Blacksmithing Skill.\n50\nRequires Kul Tiran Blacksmithing\n(150)\n\"This hammer may be used in lieu of a normal blacksmithing hammer for crafting.\"" }
